==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Demon Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Demon Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Demon Gory|Demon Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] to whittle away at the Demon Teacher Bear, [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cats]] will be able to take care of the melee threats relatively easily.

